傳語法，臣意悉受書之。臣意欲盡受他精方，公孫光曰：『吾方盡矣，不為愛公所。吾身已衰，無所復事之。是吾年少所受妙方也，悉與公，毋以教人。』臣意曰：『得見事侍公前，悉得禁方，幸甚。意死不敢妄傳人。』居有閒，公孫光閒處，臣意深論方，見言百世為之精也。師光喜曰：『公必為國工。吾有所善者皆疏，同產處臨菑，善為方，吾不若，其方甚奇，非世之所聞也。吾年中時，嘗欲受其方，楊中倩不肯，曰「若非其人也」。胥與公往見之，當知公喜方也。其人亦老矣，其家給富。』時者未往，會慶子男殷來獻馬，因師光奏馬王所，意以故得與殷善。光又屬意於殷曰：『意好數，公必謹遇之，其人聖儒。』即為書以意屬陽慶，以故知慶。臣意事慶謹，以故愛意也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"臣意","kind":"person","person_id":"yg7_rda_vb8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"慶","kind":"person","person_id":"1y5_eke_4gl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"意","kind":"person","person_id":"yg7_rda_vb8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"意","kind":"person","person_id":"yg7_rda_vb8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"意","kind":"person","person_id":"yg7_rda_vb8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"臣意","kind":"person","person_id":"yg7_rda_vb8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"慶","kind":"person","person_id":"1y5_eke_4gl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"意","kind":"person","person_id":"yg7_rda_vb8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"慶","kind":"person","person_id":"1y5_eke_4gl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"意","kind":"person","person_id":"yg7_rda_vb8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"臣意","kind":"person","person_id":"yg7_rda_vb8","